WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.213
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.313 --> 00:01.423
(All characters and organizations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.423 --> 00:02.453
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.453 --> 00:03.583
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:19.503 --> 00:20.533
I do not want to wake up.

6
00:50.763 --> 00:51.833
Did you sleep well?

7
00:54.203 --> 00:55.873
I saw you in my dreams again,

8
00:56.573 --> 00:58.173
and I really did not want to wake up.

9
01:00.013 --> 01:02.443
I am trying hard not to be happy yet.

10
01:03.513 --> 01:05.683
But today, I just want to be happy.

11
01:06.913 --> 01:08.953
Have a wonderful day, Mu Jin.

12
01:31.073 --> 01:33.143
(Episode 23)

13
01:34.983 --> 01:36.013
What is this?

14
01:39.353 --> 01:40.353
Just hit me.

15
01:40.413 --> 01:41.783
I did something that deserves a beating.

16
01:43.023 --> 01:44.223
What did you do?

17
01:45.553 --> 01:47.523
Just hit me. Hit me first, then listen.

18
01:48.993 --> 01:50.323
What, am I a gangster?

19
01:55.363 --> 01:56.433
You recognize this, right?

20
01:56.503 --> 01:59.103
The coat your father passed down to you.

21
02:00.103 --> 02:01.273
Why do you have this?

22
02:01.773 --> 02:04.843
Last night, I went on a date with a blind date,

23
02:05.243 --> 02:07.343
and I did not have anything suitable to wear, so I wore your coat.

24
02:07.413 --> 02:09.513
- Yes. - But on a park bench,

25
02:10.613 --> 02:13.053
I did not know there was wet paint, and I just sat right down on it.

26
02:17.123 --> 02:18.953
Hey, are you crazy?

27
02:19.053 --> 02:21.593
Do you know how important this coat is?

28
02:21.663 --> 02:24.163
That is why I said I deserve to be beaten to death.

29
02:24.223 --> 02:26.563
Hit me. Hit me until you are not mad anymore.

30
02:39.713 --> 02:40.743
You are not going to hit me?

31
02:43.113 --> 02:44.113
You are smiling?

32
02:44.483 --> 02:46.513
Today, no matter what you do,

33
02:46.513 --> 02:48.953
- I will forgive you. - Why? How come?

34
02:50.223 --> 02:51.653
Are you going to hit me in the head with a hammer...

35
02:51.753 --> 02:52.953
when my guard is down?

36
02:54.123 --> 02:55.123
No.

37
02:55.663 --> 02:57.693
Think of it as a Liberation Day special pardon.

38
02:58.163 --> 03:00.933
Did you reclaim some lost land or something?

39
03:01.233 --> 03:02.303
I found my lost...

40
03:02.863 --> 03:04.163
Gyu Rim.

41
03:07.003 --> 03:10.303
The only reason you survived today is all thanks to Gyu Rim.

42
03:10.843 --> 03:12.643
Thank her later.

43
03:18.983 --> 03:20.113
Thank you, Gyu Rim.

44
03:28.363 --> 03:30.263
Here, Gyeol, let us eat.

45
03:31.993 --> 03:32.993
Here.

46
03:34.563 --> 03:35.603
This looks delicious.

47
03:36.233 --> 03:37.563
Thank you for the food.

48
03:39.333 --> 03:42.073
Gyeol, listen to me carefully while you eat.

49
03:45.243 --> 03:46.413
I am going to...

50
03:46.943 --> 03:49.213
do my absolute best for Mu Jin from now on.

51
03:49.513 --> 03:53.053
I will not avoid him anymore, and I will not do anything weird.

52
03:53.283 --> 03:56.153
I am truly going to give it my all.

53
04:00.693 --> 04:01.823
That is a good idea.

54
04:02.463 --> 04:06.133
I swear on you that I will do my best,

55
04:09.933 --> 04:13.533
but I do not think love always has to end in marriage.

56
04:13.533 --> 04:14.603
Why?

57
04:14.603 --> 04:17.343
You get married because you love each other.

58
04:18.643 --> 04:21.243
People can get married without being in love,

59
04:21.413 --> 04:23.943
and people who are in love might not be able to get married.

60
04:25.083 --> 04:29.583
So even if Mu Jin and I do not end up getting married,

61
04:29.853 --> 04:31.793
promise me you will not be too disappointed...

62
04:32.393 --> 04:33.623
and that you will understand.

63
04:35.893 --> 04:37.493
When I first served this bean sprout soup,

64
04:37.563 --> 04:39.933
it was really hot. How is it now?

65
04:40.333 --> 04:42.163
It has probably cooled down a lot. Do you want to try it?

66
04:46.573 --> 04:48.203
Yes, it cooled down a lot.

67
04:49.773 --> 04:51.303
People's feelings are like that too.

68
04:52.243 --> 04:54.043
Even if you like someone a lot right now,

69
04:54.313 --> 04:55.543
as time passes,

70
04:55.613 --> 04:57.813
those feelings can cool down like this bean sprout soup.

71
04:58.553 --> 05:00.183
His feelings might cool down,

72
05:00.253 --> 05:01.883
and my feelings might cool down, too.

73
05:02.153 --> 05:05.393
Then you can just heat them back up in the microwave.

74
05:07.753 --> 05:10.363
There are some things you cannot heat back up in the microwave.

75
05:10.823 --> 05:12.663
You cannot do that with people's feelings.

76
05:14.263 --> 05:15.733
Like how no matter how hard I try,

77
05:16.103 --> 05:18.203
I cannot bring myself to like Grandpa?

78
05:20.633 --> 05:24.043
I suppose I cannot say...

79
05:24.103 --> 05:27.013
that is a bad comparison.

80
05:28.643 --> 05:30.013
I know what you mean.

81
05:31.143 --> 05:33.113
I try not to be like that,

82
05:34.053 --> 05:37.953
but my cold feelings toward Grandpa will not warm up again.

83
05:38.493 --> 05:42.693
The youngest uncle said his heart turns into ice...

84
05:43.463 --> 05:44.793
whenever he sees Grandpa.

85
05:48.093 --> 05:51.003
Seriously. What kind of father acts like this?

86
05:51.533 --> 05:52.673
What did I do?

87
05:53.133 --> 05:55.443
- What did I do wrong? - I mean,

88
05:55.973 --> 05:58.343
what kind of amazing romance are you having...

89
05:58.713 --> 05:59.943
that taking my brother's clothes isn't enough,

90
06:00.013 --> 06:01.343
so you have to steal his cologne, too?

91
06:02.083 --> 06:03.813
You have never even bought him a single pair of socks.

92
06:04.013 --> 06:05.283
Did you see whether I bought...

93
06:05.353 --> 06:07.853
Gyu Oh a pair of socks or not?

94
06:08.053 --> 06:11.693
When I was making good money, I even bought your brother a suit.

95
06:12.023 --> 06:14.153
Han Gyu Oh was the prince of Pyeongchang-dong.

96
06:14.593 --> 06:15.923
If your mother had not had an affair...

97
06:15.993 --> 06:19.133
- and run off with all my wealth... - Exactly.

98
06:19.533 --> 06:21.703
Why did you bring a woman like that into our home?

99
06:22.733 --> 06:25.003
Why did you kick out such a good person...

100
06:25.003 --> 06:26.573
like Gyu Rim's mother for a con artist like her?

101
06:26.803 --> 06:28.773
She was pregnant with you two, so what could I do?

102
06:29.243 --> 06:30.943
She threatened to get rid of you...

103
06:31.003 --> 06:32.843
if I did not give her the room. What could I do?

104
06:32.943 --> 06:34.773
You should have just let her get rid of us.

105
06:35.283 --> 06:37.213
It would have been better if Gyu Min and I were never born.

106
06:37.283 --> 06:38.953
You little punk, is that something to say to your father?

107
06:39.013 --> 06:42.923
You little brat. Is there anything around here? You little brat.

108
06:44.023 --> 06:45.193
Gyu Rim.

109
06:45.893 --> 06:49.863
Gyu Seo is asking why I had him and Gyu Min,

110
06:49.923 --> 06:52.633
driving a nail through my heart again.

111
06:55.633 --> 06:56.633
You.

112
06:57.003 --> 06:58.673
I told you not to say things like that, did I not?

113
06:59.073 --> 07:01.743
I told you I would not let it slide if you said that one more time.

114
07:02.773 --> 07:04.243
You could offer me the whole world,

115
07:04.643 --> 07:06.543
and I still would not trade Gyu Min and Gyu Seo for it.

116
07:07.573 --> 07:09.583
Who do you think you are to talk about my precious siblings...

117
07:09.643 --> 07:11.643
so carelessly like that?

118
07:12.083 --> 07:14.783
Do you really want me to teach you a lesson? Seriously.

119
07:23.623 --> 07:25.293
Look at that punk.

120
07:25.293 --> 07:28.803
He is strong against the weak and weak against the strong.

121
07:29.133 --> 07:32.303
He cannot even say a word when his sister scolds him,

122
07:32.373 --> 07:33.503
not a single word,

123
07:33.573 --> 07:36.503
but to his weak father, he screams and threatens me.

124
07:36.573 --> 07:37.703
That kid,

125
07:38.143 --> 07:39.973
when I am dead and he has no one to mistreat,

126
07:40.043 --> 07:42.313
what is he going to do?

127
07:42.783 --> 07:44.913
You have not done anything right either, Father.

128
07:45.183 --> 07:46.353
I...

129
07:46.683 --> 07:48.953
have never once said that I did a good job.

130
07:49.383 --> 07:51.283
I just could not help it.

131
07:51.523 --> 07:54.723
I am so charming that women will not leave me alone.

132
07:54.793 --> 07:57.893
- I could not stop them on my own. - Why did you say such useless...

133
07:57.963 --> 07:59.133
things to Gyeol again?

134
08:00.293 --> 08:02.503
What did I say to Gyeol?

135
08:02.863 --> 08:05.033
Why is Gyeol a burden?

136
08:05.633 --> 08:07.703
Why would you say something like that where he can hear you...

137
08:07.833 --> 08:09.773
and break my baby's heart?

138
08:12.873 --> 08:13.973
I...

139
08:14.343 --> 08:16.283
Did Gyeol hear me?

140
08:18.343 --> 08:19.353
Listen to me.

141
08:20.153 --> 08:21.953
If I had to choose between Gyeol and you,

142
08:22.023 --> 08:23.483
I would choose Gyeol every single time.

143
08:24.123 --> 08:25.223
Do you mean that?

144
08:26.053 --> 08:27.723
I am your own flesh and blood who gave you life.

145
08:27.793 --> 08:31.493
Gyeol is my son too. I gave birth to him.

146
08:32.063 --> 08:35.133
He is the most precious and most important thing to me,

147
08:35.203 --> 08:37.163
and I gave birth to him with my heart.

148
08:38.633 --> 08:41.633
I just meant that blood is thicker than water,

149
08:42.473 --> 08:44.403
and my own child is more important to me than yours.

150
08:44.603 --> 08:46.413
If my child sheds a tear,

151
08:47.473 --> 08:49.683
your child will shed tears of blood.

152
08:50.883 --> 08:52.153
Why do you not understand that?

153
09:00.323 --> 09:01.493
Gyeol...

154
09:02.163 --> 09:04.823
So that little kid heard me?

155
09:06.893 --> 09:08.833
If I ever talk on my cell phone in the house again,

156
09:08.903 --> 09:11.663
I am a true son of a gun.

157
09:12.403 --> 09:13.973
Why did I do that?

158
09:14.603 --> 09:17.143
But that little kid sure has some sharp ears.

159
09:25.583 --> 09:27.283
What is with that look? Did something happen?

160
09:30.783 --> 09:34.193
That is the face of someone who just fought with Dad.

161
09:34.353 --> 09:35.563
Let's just go to school.

162
09:36.023 --> 09:38.763
Why bother fighting with Dad? It will only make your blood boil.

163
09:38.833 --> 09:41.093
Why? What happened today?

164
09:42.003 --> 09:43.303
Hey, Han Gyu Seo.

165
09:49.873 --> 09:52.443
Why? Is it because Dad got a girlfriend?

166
09:53.073 --> 09:55.643
- How did you know? - How did you know?

167
09:55.713 --> 09:57.183
It would be weirder not to know.

168
09:57.413 --> 09:59.553
When he is being so ridiculous and making it so obvious.

169
10:00.583 --> 10:02.723
Why is our dad so ridiculous?

170
10:03.023 --> 10:04.723
We are always the ones who have to be embarrassed.

171
10:05.253 --> 10:07.793
But to older women, Dad probably is charming.

172
10:07.953 --> 10:10.323
He looks incredibly young for his age, dresses well,

173
10:10.393 --> 10:13.163
is optimistic about everything, and is innocent like a child.

174
10:14.193 --> 10:15.433
Sometimes he is cute.

175
10:15.963 --> 10:17.933
If you cover his eyes, he looks like a movie star for half a second.

176
10:21.333 --> 10:22.873
I was already regretting saying that.

177
10:24.443 --> 10:25.843
You have today off from your part-time job, right?

178
10:26.573 --> 10:27.573
Yes. Why?

179
10:28.313 --> 10:29.613
Let's go see the lady.

180
10:30.243 --> 10:32.413
- The lady? - Gyu Rim's mom.

181
10:32.913 --> 10:36.883
Do you really like her that much? What is so great about her?

182
10:38.183 --> 10:39.353
I just do.

183
10:39.823 --> 10:43.293
- She is warm. - Why? Are you cold?

184
10:45.833 --> 10:46.833
Why?

185
10:46.893 --> 10:48.603
I know you have been following us, so come out.

186
10:49.233 --> 10:50.403
Who is following us?

187
10:51.103 --> 10:54.703
Stop hiding and come out. I heard your footsteps.

188
11:21.163 --> 11:24.233
Who is my fan? Is it your daughter, or is it you?

189
11:27.203 --> 11:29.743
Well, the thing is...

190
11:33.413 --> 11:34.413
It is me.

191
11:34.973 --> 11:36.143
I am your fan.

192
11:37.613 --> 11:40.383
Would you like an autograph? Or should I take a picture with you?

193
11:40.753 --> 11:42.783
A picture. Please take a picture with me.

194
11:46.823 --> 11:47.823
Here.

195
11:50.163 --> 11:53.663
- I am taking it. One, two... - Wait a minute.

196
11:54.163 --> 11:56.233
Can that student take a picture with us too?

197
11:57.663 --> 11:59.773
- Me? - Yes, you.

198
12:00.073 --> 12:02.103
You two look like twins.

199
12:03.303 --> 12:04.803
How did you know we are twins?

200
12:07.713 --> 12:09.143
She must be your stalker fan.

201
12:10.683 --> 12:12.183
Just take the picture with Han Gyu Seo.

202
12:12.253 --> 12:14.353
He is the model. I am just a regular person.

203
12:14.753 --> 12:16.923
Do not be like that. Let's take it together.

204
12:18.223 --> 12:19.753
We have to get to school soon.

205
12:19.993 --> 12:21.393
Let's just take one with the two of us.

206
12:21.653 --> 12:26.233
She looks so much like the daughter I lost when she was young.

207
12:27.093 --> 12:30.603
Just think of me as your mom and take one picture with me.

208
12:31.463 --> 12:33.103
What is with this stalker lady?

209
12:33.303 --> 12:36.303
- Do something about her. - She hates taking pictures.

210
12:36.403 --> 12:37.803
Let's just take one with the two of us.

211
12:43.213 --> 12:45.783
Hey, come here. Let's take a picture with her.

212
12:48.723 --> 12:51.453
Link arms too. Now, look here.

213
12:51.523 --> 12:53.953
One, two, three, smile.

214
12:55.623 --> 12:57.363
One more time. Smile.

215
13:00.763 --> 13:02.363
(General Ward B)

216
13:25.923 --> 13:26.923
Are you awake?

217
13:28.053 --> 13:29.923
How are you feeling?

218
13:32.433 --> 13:33.593
I am fine.

219
13:36.203 --> 13:39.273
Well, they said it was stress-induced stomach cramps.

220
13:39.933 --> 13:42.773
I thought you were made of steel...

221
13:42.843 --> 13:45.243
and would not even flinch if lightning struck,

222
13:46.173 --> 13:48.273
but I guess you get stressed too?

223
13:48.413 --> 13:51.183
This is so embarrassing.

224
13:51.943 --> 13:56.153
Yes, it must be embarrassing. It must be incredibly embarrassing.

225
13:57.123 --> 14:01.593
You made such a huge fuss to your family, acting like you were...

226
14:01.723 --> 14:04.523
becoming the Queen of Monaco, showing off to everyone,

227
14:04.993 --> 14:06.863
so it must be very embarrassing.

228
14:07.793 --> 14:09.903
Even I am embarrassed for you.

229
14:11.103 --> 14:12.473
Why did you bring me to the hospital?

230
14:12.673 --> 14:14.033
You should have just let me die of embarrassment.

231
14:14.103 --> 14:15.643
Why did you bring me here?

232
14:16.943 --> 14:18.143
Is it my fault again?

233
14:19.443 --> 14:21.173
Do not tell my family.

234
14:21.573 --> 14:23.213
If you breathe a word of this to them,

235
14:23.343 --> 14:25.213
I will not let you get away with it. I will destroy you.

236
14:25.283 --> 14:27.583
I would not do it even if you paid me.

237
14:28.113 --> 14:29.783
If Gyu Rim knew you ended up like this,

238
14:29.853 --> 14:31.283
she would faint.

239
14:33.353 --> 14:35.353
Faint, my foot.

240
14:35.523 --> 14:38.193
She would be thrilled and say it serves me right.

241
14:38.763 --> 14:41.693
She would be so overjoyed that she might faint from happiness.

242
14:42.533 --> 14:43.703
You know...

243
14:44.603 --> 14:47.333
Out of all the kids I know, when it comes to being wicked,

244
14:47.403 --> 14:49.143
you are second place in the whole country. Second place.

245
14:50.343 --> 14:52.003
Your husband Sung Wook is first place.

246
14:53.913 --> 14:54.913
Kang Sung Wook.

247
14:55.543 --> 14:58.013
- Has he not contacted you? - Why would he not?

248
14:58.343 --> 15:00.013
Asking where you are, saying he knows...

249
15:00.083 --> 15:01.383
that the two of us are together.

250
15:01.453 --> 15:02.923
He called 100 times. That is 100 times.

251
15:03.583 --> 15:05.453
I heard you turned your phone off.

252
15:08.553 --> 15:11.823
Why? What is it?

253
15:12.863 --> 15:14.233
Besides him cheating on you...

254
15:14.493 --> 15:17.233
and his paranoia, is there something else?

255
15:17.703 --> 15:19.673
Tell me. What is it?

256
15:24.273 --> 15:25.543
Please hide me.

257
15:26.373 --> 15:28.073
What is she talking about now?

258
15:28.143 --> 15:30.783
Somewhere that jerk cannot find me, please hide me away.

259
15:30.843 --> 15:32.453
So he cannot see a single hair on my head.

260
15:33.683 --> 15:36.023
Where am I supposed to hide a grown adult?

261
15:36.183 --> 15:39.293
If you were the size of a peanut, I could carry you in my pocket.

262
15:40.693 --> 15:41.793
I mean...

263
15:41.953 --> 15:44.363
If you were not going to hide me, why did you save me?

264
15:44.423 --> 15:45.633
You should have just let me die from the pain.

265
15:45.693 --> 15:47.433
Why did you bring me to the hospital?

266
15:50.403 --> 15:51.803
When I was marrying Kang Sung Wook,

267
15:52.133 --> 15:54.033
why did you not try harder to stop me?

268
15:54.573 --> 15:56.973
You said you were a brother he really liked,

269
15:57.103 --> 15:59.473
so how did you not know that he was such a jerk? Why?

270
15:59.543 --> 16:01.743
How could you not know? How?

271
16:02.613 --> 16:04.783
Lord, my gosh.

272
16:06.253 --> 16:08.553
What should I do with this reckless lamb...

273
16:08.613 --> 16:10.283
who is acting so shamelessly?

274
16:11.683 --> 16:13.023
Goddess of mercy.

275
16:13.453 --> 16:14.723
Darn it...

276
16:20.333 --> 16:23.733
Hey, you said we would eat together, so how could you eat without me?

277
16:25.533 --> 16:27.303
Let us just have dinner after work.

278
16:27.373 --> 16:28.533
But we agreed to eat together...

279
16:30.773 --> 16:32.373
Having everyone stare at me makes me nervous.

280
16:38.383 --> 16:40.053
Very good.

281
16:44.053 --> 16:45.553
I feel like I will be eliminated in the preliminaries.

282
16:46.693 --> 16:50.163
By the way, how many teams made it to the finals this year?

283
16:50.163 --> 16:51.923
Yes. There are 14 teams in total.

284
16:52.063 --> 16:53.733
That is two more teams than last year.

285
16:54.363 --> 16:55.563
I see.

286
16:56.463 --> 16:59.433
But seeing it out here like this,

287
17:00.403 --> 17:02.003
the colors of this year's fall products are really nice.

288
17:02.003 --> 17:04.743
- Yes. Right? Yes, yes. - They are great.

289
17:05.343 --> 17:07.373
Those young men over there look very handsome, like models.

290
17:07.543 --> 17:09.443
Is it because our company's clothes are nice?

291
17:09.513 --> 17:10.513
Of course. Thank you.

292
17:10.613 --> 17:11.683
- Sir. - Yes.

293
17:17.223 --> 17:18.223
That is enough.

294
17:25.463 --> 17:27.933
Well then, please prepare well for tomorrow's competition...

295
17:28.263 --> 17:31.333
- and get back to work. Yes. - Understood.

296
17:31.503 --> 17:32.603
I will escort you this way.

297
17:44.883 --> 17:45.883
Keep up the good work.

298
17:47.513 --> 17:48.583
- Thank you. - Yes.

299
17:48.713 --> 17:51.223
Hello, Chairman.

300
17:52.423 --> 17:53.423
Hello.

301
17:55.393 --> 17:56.763
- Hello. - Yes.

302
17:57.523 --> 17:59.263
By the way, our clothes look really good on you.

303
17:59.693 --> 18:01.193
You could be a model for our company.

304
18:02.433 --> 18:03.963
- Thank you. - Yes.

305
18:05.033 --> 18:06.233
Wait, hold on a second.

306
18:07.703 --> 18:08.703
Well...

307
18:11.003 --> 18:12.613
Give me a call whenever you are free.

308
18:12.613 --> 18:14.513
Let us grab a meal together.

309
18:20.083 --> 18:21.083
I am sorry,

310
18:21.713 --> 18:24.353
but I do not eat with people I do not know.

311
18:25.623 --> 18:26.623
I apologize.

312
18:28.823 --> 18:29.823
Here.

313
18:34.293 --> 18:37.603
Chairman, I will make sure he contacts you.

314
18:52.513 --> 18:53.813
Hey, why did you take that?

315
18:54.553 --> 18:56.183
I have no reason to eat with the Chairman.

316
18:56.983 --> 18:59.653
Hey, you should make a reason, man.

317
18:59.723 --> 19:02.423
Other people are making a huge fuss just to make eye contact...

318
19:02.563 --> 19:04.123
with the Chairman.

319
19:05.363 --> 19:06.363
Whatever,

320
19:06.963 --> 19:09.233
I am not interested, so you go if you want to.

321
19:11.533 --> 19:13.503
You are so frustrating.

322
19:15.403 --> 19:17.103
Hey, take this and go ahead.

323
19:20.543 --> 19:22.583
Anyway, I saved the Chairman's number,

324
19:22.583 --> 19:23.643
so keep that in mind.

325
19:27.153 --> 19:29.183
Drink some iced coffee and cheer up today.

326
19:30.083 --> 19:31.383
Make sure to eat something sweet...

327
19:31.453 --> 19:33.423
and become a bit sweeter, Han Gyu Oh.

328
19:37.693 --> 19:38.893
What am I to you?

329
19:40.833 --> 19:43.363
You said only Kwon Hee Na matters to you.

330
19:44.303 --> 19:45.463
You said I am the only one.

331
19:46.103 --> 19:47.633
But how can you treat me like this?

332
19:49.703 --> 19:51.203
If we did not meet like this today,

333
19:52.203 --> 19:53.513
were you never going to see me again?

334
19:57.713 --> 20:00.453
Have you heard of someone turning to stone from waiting?

335
20:01.713 --> 20:04.183
I almost turned into a stone waiting for you.

336
20:04.883 --> 20:07.423
In class the other day, I even said...

337
20:07.523 --> 20:09.123
that 4 times 9 is 49.

338
20:10.963 --> 20:13.393
My brain is turning to stone this much because of you,

339
20:13.633 --> 20:15.063
so how are you going to take responsibility?

340
20:17.703 --> 20:19.333
Who am I talking to right now?

341
20:21.133 --> 20:22.203
Who do you think you are?

342
20:22.973 --> 20:25.003
I am asking you so many questions,

343
20:25.273 --> 20:27.113
so why are you keeping your mouth shut and not answering?

344
20:29.383 --> 20:31.183
You have so many questions,

345
20:33.083 --> 20:34.453
but why do you never ask...

346
20:35.153 --> 20:36.153
what kind of guy I am?

347
20:38.383 --> 20:39.393
What?

348
20:39.653 --> 20:40.853
What kind of guy I am...

349
20:41.793 --> 20:43.423
and what I do for a living,

350
20:44.163 --> 20:45.163
are you not curious?

351
20:46.593 --> 20:47.693
I am not curious.

352
20:48.393 --> 20:50.133
I do not care even if you are unemployed.

353
20:52.103 --> 20:53.303
I was a host bar worker.

354
21:01.143 --> 21:02.213
That scares you, doesn't it?

355
21:08.713 --> 21:10.083
You said "was."

356
21:12.423 --> 21:13.953
That is past tense.

357
21:15.893 --> 21:17.063
It is not in the present tense.

358
21:19.793 --> 21:20.833
Are you not surprised?

359
21:21.633 --> 21:24.403
I was shocked to death, in the past tense.

360
21:26.203 --> 21:29.003
- What? - The past is not important.

361
21:29.873 --> 21:31.503
Why does something that has already passed matter?

362
21:32.873 --> 21:34.543
It would matter if it were in the present tense.

363
21:35.043 --> 21:36.743
If you said, "I am a host bar worker now."

364
21:37.483 --> 21:38.613
I would kill you.

365
21:39.713 --> 21:41.613
I have no interest in your past.

366
21:42.313 --> 21:43.483
So what is it now?

367
21:46.123 --> 21:49.023
Is it "Han Gyu Oh loved Kwon Hee Na"?

368
21:49.793 --> 21:50.793
Or "loves"?

369
21:53.193 --> 21:55.463
Is it past tense, or present tense?

370
21:56.463 --> 21:57.563
Are you going to answer?

371
21:59.063 --> 22:00.303
I am seriously going to get mad.

372
22:27.393 --> 22:29.663
I love you. Present tense.

373
22:30.203 --> 22:32.603
It is present tense!

374
22:46.713 --> 22:49.783
I apologize for not visiting properly all this time.

375
22:51.353 --> 22:52.453
I was wrong.

376
22:56.893 --> 22:58.123
Did you change your strategy?

377
22:58.863 --> 23:00.193
Did Han Gyu Rim tell you to come here...

378
23:00.363 --> 23:01.363
and beg unconditionally?

379
23:02.493 --> 23:04.033
I want to reconcile with you, Mother.

380
23:05.133 --> 23:06.703
I asked if Han Gyu Rim put you up to this.

381
23:08.373 --> 23:10.473
Did she send you here?

382
23:12.813 --> 23:13.813
Yes.

383
23:14.873 --> 23:15.873
What?

384
23:16.843 --> 23:18.183
She told me to reconcile with you...

385
23:18.783 --> 23:21.783
and get your permission.

386
23:24.183 --> 23:25.183
Get up.

387
23:26.653 --> 23:27.723
Get up.

388
23:28.793 --> 23:29.923
Get up!

389
23:31.993 --> 23:34.493
Get up. Get up!

390
23:35.293 --> 23:36.433
Get up, you fool!

391
23:38.063 --> 23:39.103
Hey, you fool.

392
23:40.133 --> 23:42.503
Are you really doing this because of some girl,

393
23:42.573 --> 23:43.973
kneeling down like this?

394
23:44.703 --> 23:46.513
Do you think I wanted to see you like this...

395
23:47.173 --> 23:48.373
when I gave birth to you,

396
23:49.213 --> 23:51.383
fed you, clothed you, and educated you?

397
23:53.853 --> 23:54.953
I was wrong.

398
23:55.553 --> 23:56.953
Even though you were wrong,

399
23:57.953 --> 23:59.223
I should not have left...

400
23:59.893 --> 24:01.193
and taken things that far.

401
24:02.353 --> 24:03.793
Did you just say I was wrong?

402
24:04.363 --> 24:06.963
How was I wrong?

403
24:11.863 --> 24:13.173
You said the most important thing...

404
24:13.233 --> 24:14.903
in the world is a person's character,

405
24:15.333 --> 24:17.943
but you only looked at her appearance...

406
24:18.103 --> 24:19.103
and her background.

407
24:19.513 --> 24:21.943
You judged and dismissed her by worldly standards,

408
24:22.883 --> 24:24.143
misunderstood her, and rejected her.

409
24:25.943 --> 24:27.913
Is Han Gyu Rim really that amazing?

410
24:29.483 --> 24:31.583
Is she that incredible?

411
24:33.053 --> 24:35.423
How did that girl bewitch you so much?

412
24:36.723 --> 24:40.133
My son, who used to be so smart, has completely lost his reason...

413
24:40.193 --> 24:42.763
- and his judgment is clouded. - Please, Mother,

414
24:43.533 --> 24:45.463
it is my life to live,

415
24:47.103 --> 24:48.633
so can you not just trust me?

416
24:49.803 --> 24:52.573
How about you trust your mother's words...

417
24:52.643 --> 24:56.683
- just this once? - If you embrace Gyu Rim once...

418
24:57.043 --> 24:58.083
and acknowledge her...

419
24:59.083 --> 25:02.213
as the woman your son loves just this once,

420
25:03.123 --> 25:04.283
I will never ask you for anything else...

421
25:04.353 --> 25:05.623
for the rest of my life.

422
25:22.333 --> 25:25.643
Yes, 6kg each of potatoes and onions,

423
25:25.773 --> 25:27.773
and 4kg of zucchini, plus 5kg of cucumbers.

424
25:28.043 --> 25:29.513
And how are the bellflower roots?

425
25:30.283 --> 25:33.383
You know they were completely dry and mushy last time, right?

426
25:34.613 --> 25:36.553
Yes, just 4kg of bellflower roots, please.

427
25:36.923 --> 25:37.923
Yes.

428
25:42.223 --> 25:44.563
Yes, please take care of it. Yes, thank you.

429
25:47.833 --> 25:50.263
You are back to normal today.

430
25:51.633 --> 25:52.633
Yes.

431
25:53.533 --> 25:56.003
We open for business in two days.

432
25:56.943 --> 26:00.773
- Is the boss not here? - She does not run...

433
26:00.843 --> 26:02.013
the side dish shop anymore.

434
26:02.113 --> 26:03.743
She left this place to me...

435
26:04.083 --> 26:06.913
and runs the store right across the street.

436
26:06.983 --> 26:08.353
I see.

437
26:13.753 --> 26:15.153
By any chance,

438
26:15.323 --> 26:18.893
you don't have split personalities like Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde,

439
26:18.963 --> 26:20.163
do you?

440
26:21.463 --> 26:23.263
No, I do not.

441
26:23.563 --> 26:24.563
Right...

442
26:25.363 --> 26:26.373
Today,

443
26:26.433 --> 26:28.633
you know Mu Jin went to see his mother, right?

444
26:30.203 --> 26:32.103
You did not know?

445
26:32.273 --> 26:34.713
He took a day off to go see his mother.

446
26:35.143 --> 26:36.483
He said he would get her permission...

447
26:37.313 --> 26:40.153
to see you, Gyu Rim, and settle this once and for all.

448
26:43.053 --> 26:45.183
But his mother is not an easy person to deal with,

449
26:45.253 --> 26:47.193
and our Mu Jin is no pushover either, so...

450
26:47.923 --> 26:49.993
Should I call 911 just in case?

451
26:55.233 --> 26:57.133
Oh my.

452
26:57.363 --> 26:59.233
What brings you all the way here?

453
27:00.933 --> 27:04.203
You left that day without even having a meal.

454
27:04.273 --> 27:06.243
Even though I made a special dish just for you.

455
27:06.313 --> 27:07.643
I ended up doing a good deed for others.

456
27:08.743 --> 27:10.183
Have a seat first, have a seat.

457
27:11.613 --> 27:12.613
I had to, you know?

458
27:12.683 --> 27:15.683
Something came up, and I had to make myself scarce.

459
27:16.113 --> 27:19.223
Whether it goes into their mouths or my mouth, it is all the same,

460
27:19.283 --> 27:20.553
so there is no need to feel bad.

461
27:20.823 --> 27:23.863
I still feel a bit sad about it. So,

462
27:24.223 --> 27:27.463
I packed up some lasagna because I thought...

463
27:27.533 --> 27:30.433
- you would like it. - Lasagna?

464
27:30.803 --> 27:31.863
It is lasagna.

465
27:32.763 --> 27:34.633
Director Song, do you know what this is?

466
27:34.703 --> 27:37.443
Of course I do. It is a type of Italian pasta,

467
27:37.503 --> 27:39.743
and it is incredibly delicious and expensive.

468
27:39.813 --> 27:44.643
Oh, you do not have to say all that. You certainly know your stuff.

469
27:45.843 --> 27:50.023
What should I do? You have only seen me a few times.

470
27:50.483 --> 27:52.723
You really have a big heart, do you not?

471
27:54.453 --> 27:55.793
Well...

472
27:55.853 --> 27:58.893
Next to Jindo is Maenggoldo Island,

473
27:58.963 --> 28:00.193
and there is a fine young woman there...

474
28:00.263 --> 28:01.763
who harvests wild sea mustard.

475
28:02.333 --> 28:06.333
What do you say? Should I set you two up?

476
28:07.173 --> 28:09.503
What a shame.

477
28:09.843 --> 28:12.643
I did not know about such a great catch,

478
28:12.703 --> 28:14.813
and I just went on a blind date recently.

479
28:16.213 --> 28:18.513
She is from Jeopdo Island, next to Jindo,

480
28:18.783 --> 28:21.513
and I am planning to go down to meet her parents next month.

481
28:23.153 --> 28:26.083
Women from Jeopdo Island are so capable...

482
28:26.153 --> 28:28.423
people say you should marry them without even looking at their faces.

483
28:28.853 --> 28:31.493
Wait, you have already made that much progress?

484
28:31.563 --> 28:33.093
Well, you see...

485
28:33.963 --> 28:36.733
My father's health suddenly deteriorated,

486
28:37.163 --> 28:39.773
and he has been begging to see...

487
28:39.833 --> 28:41.703
his youngest daughter-in-law before he passes away.

488
28:42.333 --> 28:43.743
You are a good son.

489
28:44.273 --> 28:46.343
A devoted son like you in this day and age,

490
28:46.413 --> 28:49.273
- I have never seen one before. - Well, it's just...

491
28:49.613 --> 28:52.583
When I was young, I was a terrible son to him.

492
28:53.083 --> 28:54.583
Now that I can finally be a good son...

493
28:56.453 --> 28:59.953
he is talking about dying and all, so...

494
29:02.193 --> 29:04.423
it is just breaking my heart.

495
29:05.323 --> 29:06.733
I hear you.

496
29:07.293 --> 29:09.193
Parents don't just wait around...

497
29:09.263 --> 29:11.263
until their kids are ready to be good to them, right?

498
29:12.863 --> 29:13.873
Oh my.

499
29:14.233 --> 29:15.973
You just gave me an idea.

500
29:16.233 --> 29:18.703
To my Heung Sik, should I play a little trick?

501
29:19.713 --> 29:20.773
I'll tell him I went to the hospital...

502
29:20.843 --> 29:23.583
and that his mother doesn't have much time left to live.

503
29:23.643 --> 29:25.943
I should tell Heung Sik a little lie like that.

504
29:26.013 --> 29:27.383
That way, he will give me a grandchild...

505
29:27.453 --> 29:29.083
nice and quick.

506
29:38.563 --> 29:41.263
Gosh. Is this even human food?

507
29:44.033 --> 29:46.833
Can you go out and get me some spicy chicken feet?

508
29:47.873 --> 29:50.803
We barely healed your stomach, and you want to ruin it again?

509
29:51.243 --> 29:52.873
Just eat what you are given.

510
29:55.213 --> 29:57.143
You said I could be discharged tonight, right?

511
29:57.343 --> 29:58.343
Yes.

512
30:06.793 --> 30:07.793
Hey,

513
30:07.993 --> 30:10.023
what if you turn on your phone and Sung Wook calls?

514
30:11.363 --> 30:13.363
I am just going to make one call and turn it right off.

515
30:19.263 --> 30:21.773
- Hey, Se Hee. - What is going on with you?

516
30:21.933 --> 30:25.003
Do you know how many times I called and sent you a message?

517
30:25.673 --> 30:27.273
Sorry, something came up.

518
30:28.643 --> 30:29.743
Your husband.

519
30:29.813 --> 30:31.483
He came all the way to the office looking for you.

520
30:32.283 --> 30:34.513
I think he is still waiting in front of the building right now.

521
30:34.583 --> 30:36.553
Kang Sung Wook came to the office?

522
30:37.083 --> 30:38.523
And he is still there?

523
30:39.583 --> 30:41.453
That crazy bastard.

524
30:43.293 --> 30:45.723
Se Hee, I...

525
30:45.793 --> 30:47.963
don't want to run into him,

526
30:48.033 --> 30:49.763
so can I stay at your place for a few days?

527
30:50.233 --> 30:52.003
I am scared he might follow me to a hotel.

528
30:52.263 --> 30:57.243
Your husband knows where I live. So it is dangerous there, too.

529
30:57.743 --> 30:58.743
You are right.

530
30:59.473 --> 31:01.113
He does know where you live.

531
31:03.243 --> 31:04.513
(My Adversary)

532
31:05.243 --> 31:07.813
Hey, he is calling me right now. I have to go.

533
31:09.983 --> 31:11.923
He is waiting for you in front of your office?

534
31:12.383 --> 31:13.953
What is going on with you two?

535
31:14.623 --> 31:17.323
Why play hide-and-seek so intensely?

536
31:17.323 --> 31:18.363
It is hide-and-seek.

537
31:18.893 --> 31:20.433
If I get caught, I am dead.

538
31:21.293 --> 31:23.233
What should I do?

539
31:23.733 --> 31:25.303
Do I need to hire a bodyguard?

540
31:30.303 --> 31:33.743
Did you forget? One punch, six teeth.

541
31:36.443 --> 31:37.713
I will protect you.

542
31:38.643 --> 31:39.813
Oh, right.

543
31:40.883 --> 31:42.953
His natural enemy was right here all along.

544
31:44.683 --> 31:46.383
I am saved.

545
31:48.853 --> 31:51.663
Hey, you cannot just go around hugging a man like that.

546
31:52.093 --> 31:54.393
This is exactly why people suspect you of having an affair.

547
31:54.533 --> 31:57.233
- That startled me. - You hardly count as a man.

548
31:57.603 --> 32:01.133
Besides, we are all one people anyway.

549
32:01.333 --> 32:02.373
During the 2002 World Cup,

550
32:02.433 --> 32:04.543
even total strangers were hugging each other just fine.

551
32:06.403 --> 32:07.673
That startled me. Gosh.

552
32:12.283 --> 32:14.083
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

553
32:19.753 --> 32:20.923
Mu Jin.

554
32:22.093 --> 32:24.293
Do you realize you've been doing this for 3 hours?

555
32:25.893 --> 32:29.493
It is hard enough just sitting here, but you are even on your knees...

556
32:29.963 --> 32:31.403
Just go home for today.

557
32:31.963 --> 32:36.133
Leave for now, and come back to beg another day.

558
32:39.473 --> 32:41.973
I told you, Mom left work early today.

559
32:43.443 --> 32:46.213
Hey, staying like this will not do you any good.

560
33:00.633 --> 33:01.633
Today,

561
33:01.693 --> 33:03.803
you know Mu Jin went to see his mother, right?

562
33:04.103 --> 33:05.563
He said he would get her permission...

563
33:05.633 --> 33:08.503
to see you, Gyu Rim, and settle this once and for all.

564
33:12.503 --> 33:13.613
You are here.

565
33:14.173 --> 33:16.743
I am on my way back from Son-in-law Kim's Restaurant,

566
33:17.083 --> 33:18.543
and they said he did not come in today.

567
33:23.423 --> 33:24.583
Please accept my apology.

568
33:29.253 --> 33:32.323
If I had known Gyeol was listening, I would have to be crazy...

569
33:32.393 --> 33:34.293
to say something like that.

570
33:34.863 --> 33:37.303
I have grown so attached to Gyeol through thick and thin,

571
33:37.363 --> 33:39.233
he really feels like my own grandson now.

572
33:40.303 --> 33:42.633
He does not just feel like it. Gyeol is your grandson.

573
33:43.573 --> 33:44.703
Right, my grandson...

574
33:45.073 --> 33:48.273
I really need to watch my mouth.

575
33:49.013 --> 33:50.713
How many times am I going to get hit today?

576
33:50.783 --> 33:52.313
Han Seok Joong.

577
33:53.613 --> 33:55.253
Look at this, right here.

578
33:55.813 --> 33:58.783
I got in trouble here, see? Here. Right here.

579
34:00.793 --> 34:02.653
I hated myself so much...

580
34:02.723 --> 34:05.093
that I hit my own head so hard today.

581
34:05.163 --> 34:07.593
I have a bump here. Here. Feel it. Touch right here.

582
34:10.703 --> 34:12.033
I got a girlfriend.

583
34:16.703 --> 34:18.243
And this time, she's actually special to you?

584
34:19.443 --> 34:20.473
How did you know?

585
34:22.113 --> 34:23.243
I am just...

586
34:23.683 --> 34:25.683
wondering if we should just stay friends and date...

587
34:27.213 --> 34:29.453
or if we should go all the way to marriage.

588
34:30.083 --> 34:31.553
I am thinking about it right now.

589
34:32.583 --> 34:34.593
Do whatever you want. It is your life.

590
34:34.653 --> 34:35.853
Do you want to go first?

591
34:37.723 --> 34:39.393
Or should I go first?

592
34:42.263 --> 34:44.303
Hey, what if...

593
34:45.303 --> 34:47.233
What if, just what if,

594
34:48.003 --> 34:49.603
we end up getting married?

595
34:50.773 --> 34:52.003
How about a double wedding?

596
34:55.773 --> 34:58.543
Do you think me considering marriage at my age...

597
34:58.743 --> 35:01.153
is for my own sake?

598
35:01.483 --> 35:06.123
Not a chance. It's all for you kids.

599
35:06.553 --> 35:11.263
Taking care of your old, sick, single father is no easy task.

600
35:11.863 --> 35:16.163
I'm passing this burden of a father onto your new stepmom...

601
35:16.633 --> 35:19.463
so you kids can live comfortably.

602
35:19.533 --> 35:21.703
Such deep consideration from your father.

603
35:23.773 --> 35:27.743
Even I'm touched by my own words. Hey,

604
35:27.813 --> 35:29.873
aren't I such a cool and wonderful father?

605
35:32.543 --> 35:33.953
What kind of person is she?

606
35:35.683 --> 35:38.323
She's two years older than me, owns a sushi restaurant...

607
35:38.553 --> 35:41.823
and is an incredibly pure person untainted by this world.

608
35:42.023 --> 35:45.163
It seems her son gives her a lot of grief,

609
35:45.593 --> 35:48.193
so I think we connect well.

610
35:48.393 --> 35:50.903
I know that kind of pain better than anyone.

611
35:52.263 --> 35:55.533
Does she also want to marry you?

612
35:55.533 --> 35:57.373
Of course she does.

613
35:57.603 --> 35:59.303
She's completely head over heels for me.

614
35:59.373 --> 36:00.473
Did you tell her everything...

615
36:00.543 --> 36:01.543
without hiding anything?

616
36:02.373 --> 36:04.183
Why Mom left home,

617
36:04.383 --> 36:06.613
and that this will be your third marriage.

618
36:06.983 --> 36:08.153
Did you tell her all that?

619
36:09.513 --> 36:10.523
I think so?

620
36:11.223 --> 36:12.783
How incompetent...

621
36:13.283 --> 36:15.953
and frivolous you are. Did you confess all that too?

622
36:17.393 --> 36:18.823
Yes, I told her everything.

623
36:19.163 --> 36:21.093
That I'm unemployed and a total slacker.

624
36:21.233 --> 36:22.933
I told her everything. What are you going to do about it?

625
36:23.763 --> 36:25.263
Like I said before,

626
36:26.463 --> 36:28.803
it's your life, so live it however you want...

627
36:29.803 --> 36:31.203
but just don't hurt the kids.

628
36:32.673 --> 36:34.613
Do you think I want to hurt them?

629
36:35.013 --> 36:37.443
That's why I'm asking you to talk to them for me.

630
36:43.583 --> 36:45.723
Do you want to meet Ms. Hong?

631
36:54.133 --> 36:57.933
Anyway, you're in favor of me getting married, right?

632
36:58.603 --> 37:00.973
If you want to object, speak before I count to ten.

633
37:02.573 --> 37:05.543
I count 2, 4, 6, 8, 10. You're in favor. You agree, right?

634
37:09.773 --> 37:13.713
I'll tell the kids I didn't want to, but you forced me...

635
37:14.083 --> 37:15.353
and pushed me into it.

636
37:16.583 --> 37:18.353
Let's just say you didn't want to support your old father,

637
37:18.483 --> 37:21.253
so you dumped me on a stepmom.

638
37:21.993 --> 37:23.563
Okay? Got it?

639
37:26.593 --> 37:29.663
Hey, what's with your outfit today?

640
37:29.733 --> 37:31.603
The necklace too. You look like a kid.

641
37:31.933 --> 37:33.063
Pretty, right?

642
37:33.573 --> 37:34.733
Yes, it's pretty.

643
37:37.303 --> 37:38.303
What's this?

644
37:38.503 --> 37:41.843
- Did you make all this yourself? - The rice cooker made the rice,

645
37:42.743 --> 37:44.583
and my oldest daughter made the kimchi.

646
37:44.813 --> 37:46.013
I just scooped it out.

647
37:57.223 --> 37:58.223
It's delicious.

648
37:59.223 --> 38:00.893
Wow, it's insanely good.

649
38:01.433 --> 38:03.163
Oh my.

650
38:04.603 --> 38:06.203
You said you like home-cooked meals,

651
38:06.263 --> 38:07.903
and that as long as you have good kimchi,

652
38:07.973 --> 38:09.733
you can easily finish three bowls of rice.

653
38:09.973 --> 38:11.373
So I just took every kind of kimchi we had at home...

654
38:11.573 --> 38:12.843
and brought it all here.

655
38:18.043 --> 38:19.043
Hey.

656
38:19.383 --> 38:20.983
Your oldest daughter's cooking skills are...

657
38:22.383 --> 38:24.583
like a top hotel chef, or...

658
38:24.653 --> 38:26.123
No, she is way better...

659
38:26.183 --> 38:27.193
than the chef at our sushi restaurant.

660
38:27.253 --> 38:28.523
It is 100 times better.

661
38:28.623 --> 38:30.923
- Wow, is it that good? - Yes.

662
38:31.093 --> 38:34.193
I always eat her kimchi at home, so I never really noticed.

663
38:34.193 --> 38:35.593
I had no idea.

664
38:36.263 --> 38:39.003
Hey, what does your oldest daughter do? Is she a chef?

665
38:39.863 --> 38:42.203
- Well, something like that. - I knew it.

666
38:42.333 --> 38:45.543
This is not the work of an amateur. Wow, seriously.

667
38:49.473 --> 38:50.883
It is so good. Hey.

668
38:52.283 --> 38:53.783
Is your oldest daughter married?

669
38:55.153 --> 38:56.153
She will be soon.

670
38:56.883 --> 38:58.153
She is seeing someone.

671
39:01.293 --> 39:02.523
That guy is so lucky.

672
39:03.623 --> 39:05.293
Man, if she were single,

673
39:05.363 --> 39:07.463
I would have snatched her up as my daughter-in-law.

674
39:08.633 --> 39:09.633
Hey.

675
39:10.033 --> 39:11.433
If my daughter became your daughter-in-law,

676
39:12.063 --> 39:13.063
then what about us?

677
39:15.273 --> 39:16.773
Does that make us in-laws?

678
39:19.303 --> 39:21.873
Hey, why are you getting so serious? I was just joking.

679
39:23.943 --> 39:25.743
Gosh, you startled me.

680
39:29.953 --> 39:33.693
Hey. Tuna is always delicious, right?

681
39:33.753 --> 39:36.153
It is good when you eat out, and it is good when you eat at home.

682
39:38.493 --> 39:40.463
- My friend. - Yes?

683
39:43.593 --> 39:44.633
Do you happen to...

684
39:45.533 --> 39:46.603
see me as a woman?

685
39:49.373 --> 39:50.803
Well, you are a woman, not a man.

686
39:51.903 --> 39:52.903
No.

687
39:54.213 --> 39:55.213
I mean seriously.

688
40:02.613 --> 40:04.253
I feel the exact same way you do.

689
40:06.583 --> 40:08.993
If you see me as a friend, then I am a friend.

690
40:10.093 --> 40:11.463
If you see me as a man,

691
40:12.023 --> 40:13.023
then I see you as a woman.

692
40:16.963 --> 40:17.963
Right?

693
40:18.733 --> 40:19.733
That is how it is, right?

694
40:20.773 --> 40:21.773
We are friends?

695
40:23.433 --> 40:24.843
Has she not fallen for me yet?

696
40:30.213 --> 40:31.213
Of course.

697
40:32.413 --> 40:33.443
We are friends.

698
40:34.553 --> 40:35.553
Right.

699
40:36.953 --> 40:39.023
- We are friends. - Yes.

700
40:42.193 --> 40:47.063
Oh, my friend, my friend

701
40:47.963 --> 40:52.203
What is the passage of time?

702
40:53.133 --> 40:57.403
On the road we have traveled

703
40:58.203 --> 41:01.573
The two of us met

704
41:04.913 --> 41:05.913
Hey.

705
41:06.913 --> 41:08.383
You better be careful.

706
41:08.883 --> 41:09.883
What?

707
41:10.253 --> 41:11.323
That look in your eyes.

708
41:12.923 --> 41:14.893
That look that gives me the wrong idea.

709
41:16.553 --> 41:18.863
That look like you are completely mesmerized by me.

710
41:21.093 --> 41:25.403
"Did she fall for me?" That look that confuses me.

711
41:32.973 --> 41:34.213
Should we just stop seeing each other?

712
41:35.743 --> 41:37.543
I do not have much time left in my life,

713
41:38.343 --> 41:39.843
and I do not even have time to date women,

714
41:40.453 --> 41:41.753
so I do not have time...

715
41:41.853 --> 41:42.913
to be fooling around with a friend.

716
41:44.153 --> 41:45.553
I have to go, so hurry up and eat your lunch.

717
41:46.853 --> 41:48.053
Hey, Seok Joong.

718
41:48.593 --> 41:50.663
Seok Joong.

719
41:51.523 --> 41:52.523
Seok Joong?

720
41:52.993 --> 41:56.163
Darn it, this suit is torn too.

721
41:56.693 --> 41:58.003
Do you know how expensive this is?

722
41:58.963 --> 42:00.403
I mean, Chairman,

723
42:00.933 --> 42:03.943
what kind of employee training is this?

724
42:04.473 --> 42:07.413
How dare a lowly employee treat the Chairman's in-laws...

725
42:07.473 --> 42:09.343
with such disrespect? Darn it.

726
42:10.783 --> 42:13.683
Call them right now and fire those jerks immediately.

727
42:16.713 --> 42:19.423
They were just doing their jobs, so why should I fire them?

728
42:20.183 --> 42:21.193
I should be praising them.

729
42:22.723 --> 42:24.923
So you are going to be difficult?

730
42:26.823 --> 42:28.033
Then...

731
42:28.863 --> 42:31.403
should I be difficult too?

732
42:32.233 --> 42:34.133
Now, where is it?

733
42:34.973 --> 42:36.833
I do not know if you remember,

734
42:38.203 --> 42:39.343
but this is what you said, Chairman,

735
42:41.113 --> 42:43.273
when you pretended to be Han Seok Joong...

736
42:43.513 --> 42:45.843
at our formal meeting of the families.

737
42:46.843 --> 42:47.853
Here it is.

738
42:52.423 --> 42:56.123
Hello, in-laws. I am Sung Wook's father,

739
42:56.153 --> 42:57.623
Kang Sang Man.

740
42:58.263 --> 43:01.063
- That is my voice. - Yes, nice to meet you.

741
43:01.563 --> 43:03.693
I am Gyu Young's father, Han Seok Joong.

742
43:07.063 --> 43:08.773
You clearly said you were Han Seok Joong,

743
43:09.133 --> 43:12.103
not Jang Hoon Tae.

744
43:13.403 --> 43:15.613
Is this what they call undeniable proof?

745
43:16.813 --> 43:17.883
My son...

746
43:18.683 --> 43:20.653
asked ChatGPT or whatever...

747
43:21.453 --> 43:24.353
that thing that is way smarter than humans,

748
43:25.623 --> 43:27.453
and impersonating someone else violates...

749
43:27.653 --> 43:28.893
Article 100-something of the Criminal Act.

750
43:29.323 --> 43:31.723
Well, if I committed a crime, I should be punished.

751
43:32.393 --> 43:34.663
Why? Are you going to take legal action?

752
43:35.463 --> 43:37.903
If you want to fight it out in court, go right ahead.

753
43:38.233 --> 43:40.263
- Are you sure about this? - Yes.

754
43:40.333 --> 43:42.903
You have your social standing and your company's reputation,

755
43:43.603 --> 43:45.143
so you have a lot to protect.

756
43:45.403 --> 43:48.843
Well, I do not know what I need to protect,

757
43:49.273 --> 43:50.443
but if there is anything,

758
43:51.383 --> 43:54.913
- I should protect my family first. - Exactly.

759
43:55.553 --> 43:57.113
For someone who wants to protect his family,

760
43:57.183 --> 43:59.553
why do you keep barking up the wrong tree?

761
44:00.223 --> 44:02.653
What do you think will happen if I post this on the internet?

762
44:02.853 --> 44:05.863
First of all, Gyu Young will be completely ruined socially.

763
44:07.433 --> 44:09.593
And I heard you have a biological daughter.

764
44:10.663 --> 44:12.503
Have you not thought about the mental breakdown...

765
44:12.633 --> 44:13.703
your biological daughter will go through?

766
44:14.573 --> 44:15.573
Besides...

767
44:15.903 --> 44:17.443
imagine how humiliated your wife,

768
44:17.503 --> 44:21.273
who Gyu Young claimed was dead, will be.

769
44:22.813 --> 44:23.813
We will...

770
44:24.483 --> 44:27.013
post the detailed story...

771
44:27.083 --> 44:28.683
of your wife's divorce and remarriage, too,

772
44:29.353 --> 44:31.053
so she probably won't be able to show her face...

773
44:31.253 --> 44:33.423
in this country anymore.

774
44:36.623 --> 44:38.623
For people like us, it doesn't really matter...

775
44:38.693 --> 44:40.223
if we get three or four strikes on our record...

776
44:40.293 --> 44:43.863
or four or five. It makes no difference.

777
44:44.563 --> 44:46.603
These days, people even eat beans and rice...

778
44:46.703 --> 44:48.533
on purpose for their health.

779
44:52.443 --> 44:53.573
Someone told me that...

780
44:54.813 --> 44:56.913
solving things with money is the easiest way.

781
44:59.083 --> 45:00.543
You have a lot of money, Chairman.

782
45:01.353 --> 45:03.983
Call it a settlement, call it alimony,

783
45:04.553 --> 45:06.753
just give us 5 million dollars. Just 5 million dollars.

784
45:06.923 --> 45:09.553
We will take that and disappear cleanly.

785
45:14.363 --> 45:15.363
I do not want to.

786
45:18.203 --> 45:19.203
Chairman.

787
45:20.803 --> 45:23.473
I do not want to give a single cent to people like you.

788
45:27.743 --> 45:28.743
Get out.

789
45:30.313 --> 45:31.443
Get out right now.

790
45:32.183 --> 45:35.313
Get out, you bastard. I said get out, you bastard.

791
45:35.483 --> 45:36.653
Get out, you bastard.

792
45:37.313 --> 45:38.453
Get out.

793
45:40.793 --> 45:43.793
- Who do you think you are? - Let go, you bastard.

794
45:43.853 --> 45:46.263
What do you take me for? Darn it.

795
45:47.293 --> 45:48.293
Darn it.

796
45:49.093 --> 45:51.833
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

797
45:53.263 --> 45:56.803
This student is your twin sister, Gyu Seo?

798
45:57.573 --> 46:00.373
Yes, we are fraternal twins, and my name is Han...

799
46:01.773 --> 46:03.743
Kim Gyu Min, and I have...

800
46:04.543 --> 46:05.613
a great sense of humor.

801
46:07.113 --> 46:09.153
I also work part-time at a restaurant.

802
46:09.413 --> 46:12.523
I wash my hands often, so they get dry quickly.

803
46:12.623 --> 46:15.753
You are just a student, you do not have money for this.

804
46:15.953 --> 46:18.593
I told you I work part-time, too. Please accept it.

805
46:20.793 --> 46:22.663
Thank you. I will put it to good use.

806
46:23.793 --> 46:26.963
Do not just stand there, sit down. Sit down first. Okay?

807
46:28.173 --> 46:32.073
I will buy Gyu Seo and Gyu Min some delicious meat today.

808
46:32.503 --> 46:33.503
- Thank you. - Thank you.

809
46:33.903 --> 46:36.573
Press what you like on here. You know how to use this, right?

810
46:36.943 --> 46:38.183
You just tap it here.

811
46:41.083 --> 46:43.413
- Okay? - I know what Gyu Seo meant...

812
46:43.553 --> 46:44.723
about what he said about you earlier.

813
46:46.823 --> 46:48.093
About you being warm.

814
46:48.423 --> 46:49.953
It feels like I have known you...

815
46:50.393 --> 46:52.823
for a very long time.

816
46:53.663 --> 46:54.693
That is a compliment, right?

817
46:54.693 --> 46:55.693
- Of course. - Yes.

818
46:57.093 --> 46:59.203
Can I come visit often from now on, too?

819
47:00.133 --> 47:03.533
You students are busy, but I would be very grateful.

820
47:05.103 --> 47:06.443
Please speak comfortably with us.

821
47:07.203 --> 47:11.083
I will take my time. Go ahead and pick what you like...

822
47:11.143 --> 47:13.483
and dip it right in here like this. Take a look.

823
47:14.553 --> 47:15.683
Get something delicious.

824
47:16.553 --> 47:17.653
This looks delicious.

825
47:17.723 --> 47:19.083
(Daughter)

826
47:21.293 --> 47:22.553
The marinated ribs look delicious.

827
47:22.653 --> 47:24.523
- They do. - Seo Hyun.

828
47:24.763 --> 47:25.923
Dad...

829
47:26.823 --> 47:28.663
Dad got hurt, Mom.

830
47:29.093 --> 47:30.093
Dad got hurt?

831
47:30.733 --> 47:32.003
Where? How did it happen?

832
47:39.643 --> 47:40.643
Seo Hyun.

833
47:43.713 --> 47:44.713
Where is your dad?

834
47:47.083 --> 47:48.083
You are here?

835
47:49.113 --> 47:50.213
Really.

836
47:50.283 --> 47:51.283
It's nothing,

837
47:51.353 --> 47:52.923
so why did you call your mom?

838
47:53.353 --> 47:54.423
Your shoulder is dislocated,

839
47:54.523 --> 47:55.753
how is it nothing serious?

840
47:57.223 --> 47:59.593
It is really nothing serious,

841
47:59.663 --> 48:01.593
and I just stopped by the hospital for a bit. Yes.

842
48:01.833 --> 48:02.893
The hospital told you to get admitted,

843
48:02.963 --> 48:05.263
but you were being so stubborn and forced your way home.

844
48:05.863 --> 48:07.233
I said it is not like that, really.

845
48:07.303 --> 48:10.103
How on earth did this happen?

846
48:13.043 --> 48:15.373
Golf, I was practicing my golf swing.

847
48:15.743 --> 48:18.183
What do you mean, golf? I heard some strange man...

848
48:18.243 --> 48:19.513
came to visit you in the chairman's office.

849
48:20.183 --> 48:22.253
Where did you hear such a thing?

850
48:22.653 --> 48:24.423
What do you mean, strange man? He is my friend.

851
48:25.223 --> 48:28.553
Among my friends, there is one who imports golf clubs,

852
48:28.823 --> 48:31.223
and he brought a new product over, so I was swinging it like this.

853
48:32.523 --> 48:36.033
What kind of golf lesson were you taking for this to happen?

854
48:36.733 --> 48:38.733
I am telling you, he fought with that strange man.

855
48:41.033 --> 48:43.673
Is your father the type of person to fight with anyone?

856
48:44.133 --> 48:47.943
- He cannot even hurt a fly. - Goodness, this kid really.

857
48:48.013 --> 48:49.373
Did you get hit by him, then?

858
48:49.713 --> 48:51.613
Hey, what are you talking about, kid?

859
48:52.113 --> 48:53.443
Hey, stop writing such boring fiction.

860
48:54.083 --> 48:55.153
Right.

861
48:55.553 --> 48:57.213
You are busy, so how did you come?

862
48:58.183 --> 49:00.653
Her husband got hurt, so is his wife not supposed to come?

863
49:04.593 --> 49:06.393
If I had stayed at the hospital,

864
49:06.463 --> 49:07.593
I would not have to listen to your nagging.

865
49:07.693 --> 49:08.693
Honey, let us go inside.

866
49:09.333 --> 49:10.333
Gosh.

867
49:44.463 --> 49:47.263
I am fine. I think my ligaments are just a bit stretched.

868
49:47.333 --> 49:50.673
I mean, last time I broke my ribs too. I am fine.

869
49:56.573 --> 49:58.183
Who was the person that came to see you?

870
50:00.383 --> 50:01.383
I told you, it was a friend.

871
50:01.783 --> 50:02.783
Which friend?

872
50:03.853 --> 50:05.283
It is someone you do not know.

873
50:09.923 --> 50:11.323
Why am I so anxious?

874
50:12.923 --> 50:16.033
Do you have some kind of grudge against...

875
50:18.763 --> 50:19.963
No.

876
50:21.133 --> 50:22.633
You are not that kind of person.

877
50:24.903 --> 50:27.403
- Are you perhaps... - Perhaps what?

878
50:28.613 --> 50:30.943
Why are you writing strange fiction too?

879
50:31.643 --> 50:32.913
I said I am fine.

880
50:35.453 --> 50:37.113
I am fine. It is nothing.

881
50:41.353 --> 50:44.293
I will go get a hot towel for you to wipe your hands and face.

882
50:53.603 --> 50:56.073
Kang Sang Man, this jerk really.

883
50:58.403 --> 51:00.673
What if he does something bad to Gyu Young?

884
51:01.913 --> 51:02.913
No, now...

885
51:04.213 --> 51:05.943
Darn it.

886
51:22.693 --> 51:24.293
Are you not coming home?

887
51:25.533 --> 51:27.363
Did you leave for good?

888
51:31.203 --> 51:33.843
Are you getting a divorce? Is it because of me?

889
51:43.883 --> 51:46.123
No matter what happens from now on,

890
51:46.683 --> 51:47.993
it is not because of you.

891
51:49.593 --> 51:52.023
This is an issue between your dad and me,

892
51:52.493 --> 51:54.063
so leave it to us.

893
51:55.533 --> 51:58.163
So you are getting a divorce anyway?

894
52:00.333 --> 52:03.473
Until your dad gets better, I will be right by his side,

895
52:03.703 --> 52:05.003
so do not worry too much.

896
52:09.473 --> 52:10.813
I am telling you again,

897
52:11.583 --> 52:13.313
no matter what happens from now on,

898
52:14.143 --> 52:15.553
it is not because of you, Seo Hyun.

899
52:30.363 --> 52:33.303
(Jung Woo)

900
52:34.673 --> 52:39.243
Unless it is a real emergency, do not call, text, or message me.

901
52:43.213 --> 52:44.613
Then who am I supposed to talk to?

902
52:45.113 --> 52:46.713
Who am I supposed to call?

903
52:47.543 --> 52:50.153
What counts as an emergency, and what does not?

904
52:50.513 --> 52:51.523
Gosh.

905
52:51.983 --> 52:54.123
You were my confidant for 20 years, and now you do this?

906
52:54.323 --> 52:56.753
How can you just draw the line overnight and go on strike?

907
52:56.993 --> 52:58.823
Without even giving notice or holding a vote.

908
52:58.993 --> 53:01.463
Do you think I will accept this illegal strike, Park Jung Woo?

909
53:08.533 --> 53:11.643
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

910
54:00.883 --> 54:01.993
Mu Jin.

911
54:02.723 --> 54:03.723
What are you doing?

912
54:04.523 --> 54:05.763
Getting ready to open the shop.

913
54:07.963 --> 54:09.663
I heard you went to see your mother today.

914
54:10.793 --> 54:11.933
How did you know?

915
54:12.503 --> 54:13.503
Jung Woo told me.

916
54:15.433 --> 54:16.433
Right.

917
54:20.473 --> 54:21.473
Where are you?

918
54:21.973 --> 54:22.973
I am on my way...

919
54:24.173 --> 54:25.713
to a reunion right now.

920
54:27.913 --> 54:29.453
You are wondering how it went, right?

921
54:31.723 --> 54:33.383
I think it will take some time.

922
54:33.883 --> 54:36.593
Yes, I figured it would.

923
54:37.323 --> 54:38.523
You can wait for me, right?

924
54:39.193 --> 54:42.093
Of course, I said I would wait 100 years.

925
54:43.893 --> 54:44.903
Okay.

926
54:46.333 --> 54:47.333
That is reassuring.

927
54:48.633 --> 54:49.803
I feel relieved.

928
54:51.543 --> 54:54.143
I am sorry for making things hard for you.

929
54:55.813 --> 54:56.813
Well...

930
54:57.513 --> 54:59.583
Make sure you eat, Gyu Rim.

931
54:59.883 --> 55:01.513
You eat something good too, Mu Jin.

932
55:02.183 --> 55:03.183
I love you.

933
55:04.353 --> 55:05.353
Me too.

934
55:06.423 --> 55:08.093
I love you too, Mu Jin.

935
55:10.323 --> 55:12.793
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

936
55:37.253 --> 55:38.283
Gyu Oh.

937
55:38.283 --> 55:39.653
Is the opening preparation going well?

938
55:40.153 --> 55:41.323
Is there anything I can help with?

939
55:42.953 --> 55:44.423
No, I am fine.

940
55:46.293 --> 55:48.133
Here, this is for you.

941
55:48.633 --> 55:50.163
And this one is for Grandmother Su Nam.

942
55:52.233 --> 55:54.003
Thank you, I will enjoy it.

943
56:05.813 --> 56:07.243
Do you have something to tell me?

944
56:12.153 --> 56:13.153
What is it?

945
56:17.393 --> 56:19.463
I am seeing Gyeol's homeroom teacher.

946
56:20.993 --> 56:22.133
What are you talking about?

947
56:23.933 --> 56:25.703
Gyeol's homeroom teacher, Kwon Hee Na,

948
56:26.603 --> 56:27.703
is my girlfriend.

949
56:30.403 --> 56:31.603
What do you mean by that?

950
56:31.603 --> 56:33.243
Why would Gyeol's homeroom teacher...

951
56:33.473 --> 56:35.443
How do you know Gyeol's homeroom teacher?

952
56:40.213 --> 56:41.853
We first met in high school.

953
56:42.713 --> 56:44.313
And after going round and round,

954
56:44.923 --> 56:46.123
we finally got together today.

955
56:48.593 --> 56:49.923
People who are meant to meet...

956
56:50.623 --> 56:52.893
will eventually meet, no matter what.

957
56:56.063 --> 56:57.293
It will be the same for you.

958
56:58.633 --> 56:59.933
You and Mu Jin,

959
57:00.433 --> 57:02.533
even if the whole world tries to stop you,

960
57:03.373 --> 57:04.773
you are meant to be together.

961
57:06.403 --> 57:07.673
You will end up together.

962
57:08.413 --> 57:11.173
I tried so hard to run away, but I surrendered today.

963
57:14.343 --> 57:16.013
I wanted to tell you first.

964
57:19.883 --> 57:21.053
Even if she's my girlfriend, no perks.

965
57:21.153 --> 57:22.553
She is very strict...

966
57:22.553 --> 57:24.593
about separating personal and professional matters.

967
57:35.803 --> 57:37.803
I am rooting for you, Han Gyu Oh.

968
57:40.573 --> 57:42.743
I will always support you...

969
57:44.243 --> 57:45.283
and cheer for you.

970
57:51.583 --> 57:52.623
I knew you would.

971
57:53.553 --> 57:54.623
I knew it.

972
57:56.253 --> 57:57.323
Then I will...

973
57:58.423 --> 57:59.423
do the same for you.

974
58:02.093 --> 58:03.193
Gosh.

975
58:17.843 --> 58:20.183
You better be careful.

976
58:20.943 --> 58:22.053
That look in your eyes.

977
58:23.053 --> 58:24.923
That look that gives me the wrong idea.

978
58:27.153 --> 58:29.653
That look like you are completely mesmerized by me.

979
58:31.763 --> 58:36.493
"Did she fall for me?" That look that confuses me.

980
58:37.763 --> 58:38.833
When did I?

981
58:39.863 --> 58:40.933
When did I ever...

982
58:42.103 --> 58:44.033
look at you as if I was bewitched or had fallen for you?

983
58:44.103 --> 58:45.543
When did I ever give you that look?

984
58:46.203 --> 58:48.343
When did I ever confuse you?

985
58:49.013 --> 58:51.743
Should we just stop seeing each other?

986
58:52.143 --> 58:54.083
I do not have much time left in my life,

987
58:54.643 --> 58:56.313
and I do not even have time to date women,

988
58:57.153 --> 58:59.353
so I do not have time to be fooling around with a friend.

989
59:01.523 --> 59:02.623
I do not need it.

990
59:03.653 --> 59:05.723
I do not need a son or a friend.

991
59:06.193 --> 59:09.063
At this age, between a man and a woman,

992
59:10.093 --> 59:11.703
what kind of darn friend is that?

993
59:15.973 --> 59:16.973
Come in.

994
59:18.573 --> 59:20.143
Are you just getting off work?

995
59:22.173 --> 59:24.343
- Mother. - What is it?

996
59:24.543 --> 59:25.583
Mu Jin...

997
59:26.413 --> 59:28.143
is still in the chairman's office.

998
59:28.753 --> 59:30.313
He is still on his knees.

999
59:31.623 --> 59:34.453
- Is he crazy? - You know his stubbornness...

1000
59:34.523 --> 59:35.723
cannot be broken.

1001
59:37.723 --> 59:39.623
He is going to die at this rate.

1002
59:41.163 --> 59:44.093
If he is going to die like that, then he should die. What can we do?

1003
59:45.403 --> 59:47.263
- Mother. - Seriously.

1004
59:47.803 --> 59:49.003
Foolish boy.

1005
59:51.773 --> 59:55.013
(NDMC Namdong Hospital)

1006
01:00:08.023 --> 01:00:09.393
Are you already changed?

1007
01:00:12.893 --> 01:00:17.333
- Where do I go now? - Just close your eyes and go home.

1008
01:00:17.693 --> 01:00:20.003
I told you I would rather die than go there.

1009
01:00:20.133 --> 01:00:23.403
Then where are you going to go? You cannot go to a hotel,

1010
01:00:23.403 --> 01:00:25.003
and you cannot go to a friend's house either.

1011
01:00:25.403 --> 01:00:28.673
How have you lived your life that you only have one friend?

1012
01:00:31.643 --> 01:00:32.983
Should I just go to the Han River?

1013
01:00:33.583 --> 01:00:34.913
Or should I defect to the North instead?

1014
01:00:36.313 --> 01:00:37.813
This is driving me crazy, seriously.

1015
01:00:37.883 --> 01:00:40.083
You said you would protect me.

1016
01:00:40.383 --> 01:00:42.423
You said you could knock out six teeth with one punch.

1017
01:00:48.093 --> 01:00:50.833
If your head...

1018
01:00:51.633 --> 01:00:53.503
and my fist were to...

1019
01:00:54.403 --> 01:00:55.703
collide, what do you think would happen?

1020
01:00:56.833 --> 01:00:57.933
What are you talking about?

1021
01:00:57.933 --> 01:01:00.543
- I would be completely dead, then. - Right.

1022
01:01:00.973 --> 01:01:02.043
Exactly.

1023
01:01:02.643 --> 01:01:03.943
Let us see you drop dead, then.

1024
01:01:04.743 --> 01:01:05.743
What?

1025
01:01:05.843 --> 01:01:07.113
Hey, are you not going to do it right?

1026
01:01:07.113 --> 01:01:10.983
Oh my, what should I do with that wretched girl?

1027
01:01:13.523 --> 01:01:16.823
I know a sly fox just like her, too.

1028
01:01:19.223 --> 01:01:20.423
Is that you, Heung Sik?

1029
01:01:20.863 --> 01:01:22.593
I steamed some of your favorite rice cakes,

1030
01:01:22.763 --> 01:01:26.163
- so hurry up and come eat with me. - Do you think it will work?

1031
01:01:27.333 --> 01:01:30.273
That sly fox of a girl.

1032
01:01:31.403 --> 01:01:32.873
What are you doing?

1033
01:01:33.103 --> 01:01:35.073
Hurry up and come eat the rice cakes.

1034
01:01:36.343 --> 01:01:39.113
What is it? I am watching that, so why did you turn it off?

1035
01:01:40.613 --> 01:01:42.653
Eat this first.

1036
01:01:43.413 --> 01:01:45.923
What is this? Herbal...

1037
01:01:46.253 --> 01:01:48.793
Why would I take an herbal calming drink?

1038
01:01:49.753 --> 01:01:54.323
Then do not be too surprised and you need to brace yourself.

1039
01:01:54.893 --> 01:01:55.933
What are you talking about?

1040
01:01:57.633 --> 01:01:58.803
What are you talking about? What is it?

1041
01:01:58.863 --> 01:02:00.903
Are you bringing home a bride or something?

1042
01:02:05.873 --> 01:02:08.303
Oh my, who is that?

1043
01:02:09.913 --> 01:02:12.543
Wait, why is that girl who supposedly got married...

1044
01:02:12.613 --> 01:02:14.213
in my house at this time of night?

1045
01:02:15.113 --> 01:02:16.183
Well, Mom,

1046
01:02:16.253 --> 01:02:18.353
there is a bit of a dramatic situation.

1047
01:02:18.553 --> 01:02:19.753
I do not care about any situation,

1048
01:02:19.823 --> 01:02:21.923
so kick her out of the house right now.

1049
01:02:22.193 --> 01:02:25.963
Not having to see that sly fox was such a relief.

1050
01:02:26.293 --> 01:02:30.633
I thought I was seeing things late at night.

1051
01:02:32.033 --> 01:02:35.133
Who is the sly fox? Is she on television?

1052
01:02:35.873 --> 01:02:39.643
What? What is wrong with her right now?

1053
01:02:40.743 --> 01:02:42.273
That is what I am saying, Mom.

1054
01:02:42.713 --> 01:02:46.413
I do not like the sly fox. I am scared, ma'am.

1055
01:02:46.743 --> 01:02:48.813
Hey, the herbal calming drink.

1056
01:02:49.353 --> 01:02:51.613
I told you to take it earlier. Here.

1057
01:02:51.683 --> 01:02:53.183
Heung Sik, get rid of her, hurry.

1058
01:02:53.653 --> 01:02:56.153
Here, eat it quickly. Bottoms up.

1059
01:03:00.623 --> 01:03:02.293
Get rid of this sly fox.

1060
01:03:02.363 --> 01:03:04.633
- I am scared, Mom. - I said get rid of her.

1061
01:03:12.943 --> 01:03:16.213
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

1062
01:03:27.723 --> 01:03:29.723
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

1063
01:03:38.703 --> 01:03:39.703
Fine.

1064
01:03:40.463 --> 01:03:41.603
I lose.

1065
01:03:46.503 --> 01:03:48.373
This is exactly who Kim Mu Jin is, yes.

1066
01:03:50.343 --> 01:03:51.813
The more I try to stop you,

1067
01:03:53.843 --> 01:03:55.653
the more determined you become.

1068
01:03:57.853 --> 01:03:58.853
Fine.

1069
01:03:59.983 --> 01:04:01.583
I will allow it, so go ahead.

1070
01:04:02.753 --> 01:04:03.923
Until the two of you...

1071
01:04:04.793 --> 01:04:05.793
grow tired,

1072
01:04:06.863 --> 01:04:08.023
get sick of each other,

1073
01:04:08.733 --> 01:04:11.533
realize the truth, and fall apart,

1074
01:04:13.033 --> 01:04:14.403
take it all the way...

1075
01:04:17.273 --> 01:04:18.673
and see how it ends.

1076
01:05:11.893 --> 01:05:13.723
(Love on the Menu)

1077
01:05:13.793 --> 01:05:16.333
Muddy waters, rocky roads, I am not afraid of any of it.

1078
01:05:16.393 --> 01:05:19.063
Do you think Han Gyu Rim feels the same? Care to make a bet?

1079
01:05:19.133 --> 01:05:20.133
Mom.

1080
01:05:20.203 --> 01:05:21.763
Why did you have to live like that?

1081
01:05:22.003 --> 01:05:24.473
Why could you not live any other way?

1082
01:05:24.533 --> 01:05:26.073
Then you must have met Han Gyu Rim as well.

1083
01:05:26.143 --> 01:05:27.873
Since when have you been lying to me?

1084
01:05:27.943 --> 01:05:29.413
Who are you calling Mom?

1085
01:05:29.613 --> 01:05:31.143
How dare you call yourself my mother?

1086
01:05:31.213 --> 01:05:32.783
Take this and get out of here right now.

1087
01:05:32.843 --> 01:05:33.943
What do we do, Gyu Rim?

1088
01:05:33.943 --> 01:05:36.783
All our restaurant employees have disappeared.

1089
01:05:36.913 --> 01:05:38.723
Are you really going to leave Mu Jin penniless?

1090
01:05:38.783 --> 01:05:40.483
Mu Jin still has plenty left.
